/* TypeCompass interface and runtime messages. Keep format placeholders consistent. */
"Three languages. Your familiar input sources." = "中日英输入，沿用你熟悉的输入法。";
"PROTOTYPE" = "原型版";
"Your input sources" = "输入法设置";
"Refresh" = "刷新";
"Enable your preferred sources in macOS Keyboard settings, then map them here." = "先在 macOS 的键盘设置中启用输入法，再为下面三种语言指定对应的输入法。";
"Choose input source…" = "选择输入法…";
"Switch" = "切换";
"Switch to %@" = "切换到%@";
"Current: %@" = "当前输入法：%@";
"Finish choosing a candidate before switching. The menu bar also provides these controls." = "请先完成选词，再切换输入法。也可以从菜单栏切换。";
"Detection lab" = "语言识别实验区";
"Try Pinyin, Romaji or English. This starter vocabulary only analyzes the sample below." = "试试中文拼音、日语罗马字或英语。目前使用基础词表，仅分析下方的示例内容。";
"Language detection sample" = "用于语言识别的示例文本";
"Clear" = "清空";
"Keep current source" = "保持当前输入法";
"Local only. No global keyboard monitoring. Automatic switching is planned." = "仅在本地运行，不监听全局键盘。自动切换功能尚未实现。";
"Refresh input sources" = "刷新输入法列表";
"Open TypeCompass…" = "打开 TypeCompass…";
"Quit TypeCompass" = "退出 TypeCompass";
"Select the input sources you already use." = "请选择你平时使用的输入法。";
"Unavailable" = "无法获取";
"Could not read enabled input sources. Try Refresh." = "无法读取已启用的输入法，请点击“刷新”重试。";
"Choose an enabled input source for %@ first." = "请先为%@选择一个已启用的输入法。";
"macOS could not select %@ (error %d)." = "macOS 无法切换到%@（错误代码：%d）。";
"Selected %@. Existing text is unchanged." = "已切换到%@，已输入的文字保持不变。";
"macOS accepted the request, but the current source has not changed. Try Refresh." = "macOS 已接受切换请求，但当前输入法尚未改变，请点击“刷新”确认。";
"中文 · Pinyin" = "中文 · 拼音";
"日本語 · Romaji" = "日语 · 罗马字";
"English" = "英语";
"Type a sample to explore a language hint." = "输入一段示例，查看建议使用的语言。";
"Use a sample of 256 characters or fewer." = "请输入不超过 256 个字符的示例。";
"This prototype accepts unaccented Latin letters, spaces and apostrophes." = "当前原型仅支持不带重音符号的拉丁字母、空格和单引号。";
"Too little context. Keep the current input source." = "输入内容太短，暂时保持当前输入法。";
"Ambiguous or outside the starter vocabulary. Keep the current input source." = "暂时无法判断，或内容不在基础词表中。保持当前输入法。";
"Matched the starter vocabulary. This is a hint, not a certainty." = "已匹配基础词表。结果仅供参考，仍可能存在歧义。";

/* Opt-in live assistance and guarded retyping. */
"Live input assistance" = "实时输入辅助";
"Live assistance is off." = "实时辅助已关闭。";
"Type in another app. A language hint appears without taking focus. Press Control + Option + Return to clear this segment, switch and retype." = "在其他应用中输入，识别到可能用错语言时会弹出提示，不抢走输入焦点。按 Control + Option + Return，清除本轮输入、切换语言并重新输入。";
"Allow Accessibility" = "允许辅助功能";
"Allow Input Monitoring" = "允许输入监控";
"Allowed" = "已允许";
"Not allowed" = "未允许";
"Experimental: QWERTY letters only. Field compatibility varies. Start a fresh segment after enabling. No typed content is saved or uploaded." = "实验功能：支持 QWERTY 字母输入，输入框兼容性因应用而异。开启后请从新一轮输入开始，不保存或上传输入内容。";
"Original input for manual recovery" = "原始输入（用于手动恢复）";
"Clear recovery text" = "清除恢复内容";
"Local only. Observation is opt-in. Retyping requires your confirmation." = "本地运行，监听需主动开启，重放需快捷键确认。";
"Pause live assistance" = "暂停实时辅助";
"Enable live assistance" = "开启实时辅助";
"Allow Accessibility and Input Monitoring, then enable live assistance again." = "请先允许“辅助功能”和“输入监控”，再开启实时辅助。";
"Choose three distinct input sources before enabling live assistance." = "请先为三种语言分别选择不同的输入法，再开启实时辅助。";
"macOS could not start observation. Check permissions and relaunch the app." = "macOS 无法启动监听，请检查权限并重新打开应用。";
"Listening for a new input segment. Confirm suggestions with ⌃⌥↩." = "等待新一轮输入。出现建议后，按 ⌃⌥↩ 确认。";
"Observation was interrupted by macOS. Enable it again to start a fresh segment." = "macOS 已中断监听，请重新开启，并从新一轮输入开始。";
"Did you mean %@?" = "你是否想输入%@？";
"⌃⌥↩ Confirm: clear this composition, switch and retype." = "⌃⌥↩ 确认：清除本轮组词，切换语言并重新输入。";
"This field does not expose a verifiable composition range. Retyping is unavailable." = "此输入框未提供可核对的组词范围，暂不支持安全清除和重放。";
"Clearing only the current input segment…" = "正在清除本轮输入，保留之前的文字…";
"Switched to %@ and retyped the input. Confirm any remaining candidates normally." = "已切换到%@并重新输入。如有候选词，请继续正常选词。";
"Retyping stopped after %d of %d keys. Original input is available below; check the target field before recovering." = "重放已停止，已发送 %d / %d 个按键。原始输入保留在下方，请检查目标输入框后再手动恢复。";
